someone feel hopeless or pitied.

00:33:12.780 --> 00:33:15.330
You're damning them to
a future of failure.

00:33:15.330 --> 00:33:16.830
- Yes.
- If you are telling them,

00:33:16.830 --> 00:33:19.530
oh, I pity you and I'm going
to do these things for you,

00:33:19.530 --> 00:33:21.630
instead of coming alongside
them and supporting them

00:33:21.630 --> 00:33:23.370
in doing something for themselves

00:33:23.370 --> 00:33:25.080
that pulls them out of that hopelessness.

00:33:25.080 --> 00:33:26.610
And I think that those are
two of the worst things

00:33:26.610 --> 00:33:28.680
that we can do as a broader society.

00:33:28.680 --> 00:33:30.300
- You know what I love about America?

00:33:30.300 --> 00:33:32.040
My mother immigrated from Morocco.

00:33:32.040 --> 00:33:33.810
