00:33:44.400 --> 00:33:46.560
and to succeed based on your own merit.

00:33:46.560 --> 00:33:49.140
We don't look back into why we can't.

00:33:49.140 --> 00:33:50.760
We look into why we can.

00:33:50.760 --> 00:33:53.610
And so when my family taught
me, since I was a little girl,

00:33:53.610 --> 00:33:55.800
I can, I can, I can.

00:33:55.800 --> 00:33:57.120
I learned that I could.

00:33:57.120 --> 00:33:59.190
And that's why I think this country

00:33:59.190 --> 00:34:01.050
has empowered me so much.

00:34:01.050 --> 00:34:03.480
I wanna see the same thing
