00:34:04.350 --> 00:34:05.520
But if we're taught,

00:34:05.520 --> 00:34:08.067
if we're teaching them that
there is no hope for them

00:34:08.067 --> 00:34:11.100
and that people will always
look at them in a different way,

00:34:11.100 --> 00:34:13.290
