00:34:28.980 --> 00:34:31.650
And when teachers are
bringing those issues

00:34:31.650 --> 00:34:34.380
to the classrooms, it's forcing families

00:34:34.380 --> 00:34:38.160
and conservative kids to
have to address these issues.

00:34:38.160 --> 00:34:40.290
And we believe that
they're simply too young

00:34:40.290 --> 00:34:44.908
to deal with those kinds of
complex matters at that age.

00:34:44.908 --> 00:34:48.780
(object thwacks softly)

00:34:48.780 --> 00:34:49.620
- Okay, so first of all,

00:34:49.620 --> 00:34:52.020
