00:35:40.050 --> 00:35:43.020
I define myself as someone
who is proud of my country.

00:35:43.020 --> 00:35:44.610
Someone who can look at the mistakes

00:35:44.610 --> 00:35:46.200
that my country has made in the past,

00:35:46.200 --> 00:35:48.540
and the things that are
keeping other people oppressed,

00:35:48.540 --> 00:35:50.940
and recognize that these
