00:36:52.050 --> 00:36:54.510
- I don't believe that
there's a victimhood to it.

00:36:54.510 --> 00:36:57.150
I think it's just kind of amplifying that,

00:36:57.150 --> 00:37:00.000
hey, this is the truth,
this is what happened,

00:37:00.000 --> 00:37:02.340
and let's move forward with that.

00:37:02.340 --> 00:37:05.460
Having that knowledge to
be able to kind of navigate

00:37:05.460 --> 00:37:08.130
